  "",
  "* **Step 2: Transit Duration \\( \\tau \\)**:",
  "  \\[ \\tau = \\frac { l } { v_z } = \\frac { 0.03 \\text{ m} } { 2.6524 \\times 10 ^ 7 \\text{ m/s} } \\approx 1.1310 \\times 10 ^ { - 9 } \\text{ s} = 1.131 \\text{ ns} \\]",
